This is the princess's decision.

00:15:07.370 --> 00:15:09.470
Are you asleep already?

00:15:10.030 --> 00:15:10.880
No.

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:14.350
Ecarlate...

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:28.110
It's not my place to 
do anything at all...

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:29.490
Princess?

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:30.850
Princess!

00:15:32.210 --> 00:15:32.850
Princess!

00:15:36.940 --> 00:15:38.120
Stop it!

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:40.080
She doesn't want you to!

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:43.110
You shameless pervert!

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:47.670
Stop it, stop it, please!

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:50.250
Huh? What's going on?

00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:51.180
Are you crying?

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:53.220
Hey, what the hell?

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:54.420
What's wrong?

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:56.510
Where's the princess?

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:02.160
Princess!

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:02.770
What's wrong?

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:06.070
Hey, Kon!

00:16:06.090 --> 00:16:07.660
Don't tell me you...

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:09.870
You're horrible.

00:16:09.870 --> 00:16:10.900
You're cruel.

00:16:13.170 --> 00:16:14.960
I didn't!

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:17.230
I... I...

00:16:16.690 --> 00:16:18.580
What was that scream?

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:19.330
Kon!

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:20.120
Let's go!

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:21.080
Let's go!

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:23.120
I'll tell you later!

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:26.340
I never thought I'd be 
saying crap like this.

00:16:29.470 --> 00:16:30.840
Lord Jugglaburk!

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:33.090
Lord Jugglaburk!

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:33.090
It's not what it looks like.

00:16:33.520 --> 00:16:35.780
Lord Jugglaburk!

00:16:35.780 --> 00:16:38.330
How dare you?!

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:41.790
I was on to you!

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:42.980
Wait!

00:16:45.990 --> 00:16:46.860
Princess!

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:49.940
It's a tackle! He's strong! 
We can't stop him!

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:54.480
Kon!

00:16:57.670 --> 00:16:58.410
Take him!

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:00.540
They assassinated Lord Jugglaburk!

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:01.810
What assassination?

00:17:01.810 --> 00:17:03.860
He was alive just now.

00:17:03.860 --> 00:17:05.450
Crying like a little bitch, true...

00:17:05.450 --> 00:17:08.020
Messy and shaking like a puppy

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:11.220
that's been thrown out
 into the rain, incapable of

00:17:11.220 --> 00:17:13.410
doing anything but crying in his fear.
 He was in that pathetic and

00:17:13.410 --> 00:17:15.970
sorry state, but he was totally alive!

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:18.300
You dare to mock Lord Jugglaburk?!

00:17:22.780 --> 00:17:24.300
<i>Why am I...</i>

00:17:24.870 --> 00:17:26.270
<i>Why is the Sorority...</i>

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:28.790
<i>Why am I here?</i>

00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:33.600
<i>I won't find what I lost here.</i>

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:37.930
<i>Or is it because of a feeling,
like a weary traveler chasing a mirage,</i>

00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:40.980
<i> like iron dust being attracted by a magnet...</i>

00:17:41.570 --> 00:17:45.230
<i>Over there, the ceremony that must 
happen is happening right now.</i>

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:48.670
I'm an idiot.

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:49.950
Idiot!

00:17:54.410 --> 00:17:56.380
What is that?

00:17:58.350 --> 00:17:59.620
H-Hey...

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:10.650
Y-You?

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:12.660
It's up to you now.

00:18:12.660 --> 00:18:13.360
What?

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:19.030
What the?!

00:18:19.920 --> 00:18:21.030
What is going on?

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:22.100
Where is he?

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:23.540
After them!

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:25.590
Wh-What the...

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:28.030
I saw nothing!

00:18:28.030 --> 00:18:29.160
I saw absolutely nothing!

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:32.380
I didn't see you curled 
up and acting all pained.

00:18:33.220 --> 00:18:36.460
Whatever you were muttering about, 
we heard not a single word.

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:37.800
Leon never tells a lie.

00:18:38.290 --> 00:18:40.110
You bastards.

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:41.090
I'm cereal.

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:42.280
Super cereal.

00:18:42.280 --> 00:18:45.040
We were worried about you and so 
we were watching you from afar.

00:18:45.040 --> 00:18:47.290
That's all we were doing, I swear!

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:55.190
He's fighting him to 
cover his embarrassment.

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:56.190
Marvelous.

00:18:57.970 --> 00:18:59.360
We've come to your aid!

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:01.330
Who the hell are they?

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:02.030
How should I know?

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:02.910
You must know!

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:04.200
I don't know, but I don't care anymore!

00:19:07.530 --> 00:19:10.710
You're in cahoots with Lord 
Jugglaburk's assassins.

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:12.250
What?

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:13.950
What?

00:19:13.950 --> 00:19:15.180
When did he...

00:19:15.180 --> 00:19:16.250
Erec-sama...

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:17.740
I don't know anything about it!

00:19:17.740 --> 00:19:19.150
How dare you imply that I do?

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:21.090
You are protecting the traitors!

00:19:21.090 --> 00:19:22.680
We have proof!

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:25.350
It's just a coincidence!

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:27.980
You think that I'll buy that?

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:32.810
<i>Was I played yet again?!</i>

00:19:33.880 --> 00:19:35.320
Looks like we got away.

00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:38.350
Oh well, I'm sure they've 
got it under control.

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:39.820
Lucky!

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:41.640
He's like that bowl 
of mayonnaise rice,

00:19:41.640 --> 00:19:43.320
saving you when you've 
got nothing else to eat!

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:46.450
But princess, you were saying?

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:47.610
What happened after Nabotan?

00:19:47.610 --> 00:19:48.200
Well...

00:19:48.610 --> 00:19:49.470
Nabotan?

00:19:49.470 --> 00:19:50.430
What's that?

00:19:50.430 --> 00:19:51.900
Jugglaburk's nickname.

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:54.170
Or I should say, the name 
he made me call him.

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:57.750
So it looks like he was a plushie.

00:19:57.750 --> 00:20:01.720
Ah, that guy definitely has 
some childhood trauma.

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:03.970
I don't know about trauma,

00:20:04.370 --> 00:20:07.370
but he took great delight in 
using stuffed animals to talk for him.

00:20:07.370 --> 00:20:09.870
No wonder you couldn't stand him, then.

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:10.980
That's a huge turn-off.

00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:12.620
No, that wasn't so bad, actually.

00:20:13.490 --> 00:20:15.850
Well then, what did he make you do?

00:20:15.850 --> 00:20:16.580
He made me get into a costume.

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:18.110
What? What kind?

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:20.210
Like a white dress?

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:21.860
Princess

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:21.860
Or a school bathing suit?

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:23.860
A frill-necked lizard suit.

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:26.650
He made me get into a plushy 
frill-necked lizard suit.

00:20:26.650 --> 00:20:29.980
You could make the neck-frills 
move, like an Elizabethan collar.

00:20:29.980 --> 00:20:31.320
And Nabotan was a giraffe.

00:20:31.320 --> 00:20:31.740
Gross.

00:20:31.740 --> 00:20:33.260
That's pretty wild.

00:20:33.260 --> 00:20:35.130
No wonder you wanted to punch him out.

00:20:35.340 --> 00:20:36.630
I didn't really mind that, either.

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:38.770
Then what?

00:20:38.770 --> 00:20:39.990
What was the big problem?

00:20:39.990 --> 00:20:41.340
Looks like you were doing just fine!

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:42.740
Looks like you had an 
understanding and everything!

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:45.310
There was no reason to totally 
beat the crap out of him, then!

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:47.140
Hair.

00:20:47.960 --> 00:20:48.890
Hair?

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:52.570
From the breathing apparatus located 
in the middle of the face.

00:20:52.570 --> 00:20:53.930
Huh? What is she talking about?

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:57.190
One of the hairs that 
originates there

00:20:57.190 --> 00:20:58.900
for filtering purposes was sticking out.

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:01.710
You mean...

00:21:01.710 --> 00:21:03.620
In one word...

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:04.410
A nose hair?

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:06.160
Don't call it that!

00:21:07.170 --> 00:21:07.910
Was it bushy?

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:12.250
No, a single one!

00:21:12.730 --> 00:21:13.610
One?

00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:17.180
A single nose hair was sticking out?

00:21:17.180 --> 00:21:18.500
Stop! Don't say that!

00:21:19.400 --> 00:21:21.760
That's why you beat the 
snot out of Jugglaburk?

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:26.100
That's the only thing I can't stand.

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:27.700
Nose hair?

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:30.360
Really, a nose hair?

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:35.030
So basically Jugglaburk got 
beat up for his nose hair?

00:21:35.490 --> 00:21:37.270
Especially by you, Kon.

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:39.900
Ah yeah, that's what 
it looked like, huh?

00:21:40.660 --> 00:21:43.890
W-Wait! I told you! 
When I rushed in there,

00:21:43.890 --> 00:21:46.560
it was already after the princess 
had her cowlick rampage!

00:21:46.560 --> 00:21:47.590
Yes, that's true.

00:21:47.590 --> 00:21:49.980
We believe you. We do.

00:21:49.980 --> 00:21:51.530
You have a precious few allies.

00:21:51.530 --> 00:21:54.040
What? Why did you put it 
like that? That's scary!

00:21:54.730 --> 00:21:56.630
Well, good luck, assassin.

00:21:56.630 --> 00:21:59.250
Stop! Don't say scary stuff like that!

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:03.560
Why me?!

00:22:05.120 --> 00:22:07.050
One unconscious patient coming through!

00:22:08.740 --> 00:22:12.120
<i>Rage! Rage!</i>

00:22:14.860 --> 00:22:16.790
Who are these people?

00:22:16.790 --> 00:22:18.190
I don't know! I don't care!

00:22:18.190 --> 00:22:19.070
But!

00:22:19.810 --> 00:22:23.550
Curse you! Curse you, DT!

00:23:56.620 --> 00:23:59.480
What? Wait. That's not 
what we discussed.

00:23:59.480 --> 00:24:01.420
What else am I supposed 
to do beyond this?

00:24:01.640 --> 00:24:03.920
No, that's impossible. Impossible, 
impossible, impossible!

00:24:03.920 --> 00:24:05.640
Impossible, impossible, impossible!

00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:08.210
What? We're going that far?

00:24:08.210 --> 00:24:09.280
That's the epitome of evil.

00:24:09.970 --> 00:24:24.810
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:10.550 --> 00:24:13.020
After being wrongly accused of 
attempting to assassinate Jugglaburk,

00:24:13.020 --> 00:24:14.720
we, Incognito, have become wanted.

00:24:15.300 --> 00:24:18.270
However, that's when 
Alma Flora uses her power

00:24:18.270 --> 00:24:20.230
to whisk us away to Ixion's ruins.

00:24:20.680 --> 00:24:23.280
DT?! Why are you here?!

00:24:24.810 --> 00:24:30.030
Kon and his friends were 
gathered at Ixion's ruins.

00:24:24.810 --> 00:24:30.030
The mysterious woman who appears there 
starts to tell shocking facts.

00:24:30.030 --> 00:24:34.860
The ED changed this episode.

00:24:30.030 --> 00:24:34.860
It's a samba piece that carries the 
wish that Erec-sama can be revived.
